        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Neih thumhpui nungc ringcthau the Jisu,",
            "Theihmei ta ngamlouna, (2)",
            "Dinc kasuakloumei 1<: kumcna;",
            "Baanch’ra {:1 dinclou e. (3)",
            "",
            "2 Ringcthaupui tangv Kalwn lyanlou e,",
            "Lwmsiimei ’maan mak saanv; (2)",
            "’Thukpui latchamv ’peyna dinclou,",
            "Tingkauh tuang latchamv e. (3)",
            "",
            "3 Pu tuang latryan ’khwan khang dinclou e,",
            "Huayneyna ’khwan bam khang; (2)",
            "Bumaengh ’Thanmei tiikey mak saanv,",
            "’Khavloumeipu khang e. (3)",
            "",
            "4 Latdanv daihmei Kamei tiilou e;",
            "“Tat tho, dinc lik tat tho, (2)",
            "Meic kathuicna chutow diu khang,",
            "Lwmlouna ringc diu khang.” (3)",
            "",
            "5 Thow punic mi lat hei laaloumei,",
            "Kalat khou lwmmei guay, (2)",
            "Ringcsuangmei 1<: laatow puni;",
            "Adih dwan gaymei cho! (3)",
            "",
            "6 Thow punic mi hei laalou makmei,",
            "Lwmlou makmei guay 1<:, (2)",
            "T’ruaih maikwam lungc khou bam puni,",
            "Tingsaeng ryanra puni! (3)"
          ]
        }
